  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"bar\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"Kuaza&#95;Artike\">\n<table cellspacing=\"8\" cellpadding=\"0\" class=\"hintergrundfarbe0 rahmenfarbe1\" style=\"width: 100%; font-size: 100%; border-style: solid; margin-top: 2px; margin-bottom: 2px; clear: both\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32px\"><div style=\"position:relative; overflow:hidden; width:36px; height: 36px; z-index:2;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Datei:Wiki_puzzle.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Wiki_puzzle.svg/40px-Wiki_puzzle.svg.png?utm_source=bar.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Wiki_puzzle.svg/120px-Wiki_puzzle.svg.png?utm_source=bar.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"200\" data-file-height=\"200\" /></a></span><div style=\"position:absolute; top:0; left:0; padding-top:3px; z-index:3;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:Stub\" title=\"Wikipedia:Stub\"><span style=\"float:left; width:36px; height: 36px; font-size: 36px; line-height: 36px; white-space: nowrap; word-spacing:36px; cursor:pointer;\">&#160; &#160;</span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\">Da Artiké „<b>Geografie</b>“ is laider nuh a wengal <b><a href=\"/wiki/Kategorie:Wikipedia:Kurze_Artikel\" title=\"Kategorie:Wikipedia:Kurze Artikel\">kuerz</a></b>! <br />Waunnst meara zum Téma woasst, schraibs oahfoch dazue und moch an léngern Artiké draus.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 32px\"><div style=\"position:relative; overflow:hidden; width:36px; height: 36px; z-index:2;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Datei:Wiki_puzzle.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Wiki_puzzle.svg/40px-Wiki_puzzle.svg.png?utm_source=bar.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/Wiki_puzzle.svg/120px-Wiki_puzzle.svg.png?utm_source=bar.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"200\" data-file-height=\"200\" /></a></span><div style=\"position:absolute; top:0; left:0; padding-top:3px; z-index:3;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:Stub\" title=\"Wikipedia:Stub\"><span style=\"float:left; width:36px; height: 36px; font-size: 36px; line-height: 36px; white-space: nowrap; word-spacing:36px; cursor:pointer;\">&#160; &#160;</span></a></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>De <b>Geografie</b> is de Wissnschoft vo da Erdobaflächn, vom Roum und Oat vo da Eadn im ojgemeinen und a vo da Beschoffnheid da Eadn söbsd. Se eafosd, bschreibd und eakläat de Struktuan und de Vuagäng ouf da Eadobaflächn und emfois de Auswiakungen ouffn Menschn und de Hondlungen vo d'Menschn. De Geografie buidt de Bruggn zwischn de oanzelnen Natua- und Sozjoiwissnschofftn. Se enwtickit de Konzepte zua Vaständnis und zua Löösung vo de Probleme zwischn da Wöd und' Menschn. Gegnstond vo da Geografie is de gsommte <a href=\"/wiki/Geosph%C3%A4re\" title=\"Geosphäre\">Geosfäre</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.eqiad.main‐7d6c87b8df‐tct2x\nCached time: 20261005112136\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update]\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 51/1000000\nRevision size: 597/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 2129/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 130/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expan